  (text "LED = one WS2812B-2020 pixel cut from a 5 mm strip: DI, DO, 5V, GND.\nTop detect = 2-pin pogo connector: DET, and GND jumped from the LED GND pad.\nThe brass shim in the topper shorts the pogo pins: TOP_DET reads LOW when the top is on." (at 25.4 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a0c04067-1e0e-48d6-843a-980704e555c8))
